OL,3,GNEWSA'Beating Luke Littler will change
OL,4,Amy daughter's life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hereford dad is hoping to succeed in
OL,7,Fa huge darts challenge and win #501,000
OL,8,Fby beating world champion, Luke
OL,9,FLittler.
OL,11,FZac Griffiths, 25, is among 24 amateur
OL,12,Fplayers chosen to take part in
OL,13,FNetflix's live special 'Beat Luke
OL,14,FLittler', which will be broadcast from
OL,15,Fthe Manchester Central Convention
OL,16,FComplex on 30 October.
OL,18,FEach contestant will face Littler in a
OL,19,Fsingle leg of 501, with anyone who
OL,20,Fbeats the two-time world champion
OL,21,Flanding the #501,000 prize before the
OL,22,Fcompetition comes to an immediate end.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
